WEBVTT

00:03:28.876 --> 00:03:32.116
Have hope, but tie your camel first.

00:03:32.156 --> 00:03:35.316
And then be like Elsa from "Frozen"

00:03:35.356 --> 00:03:36.756
and let the rest go.

00:03:37.076 --> 00:03:38.196
Number two:

00:03:39.076 --> 00:03:40.996
invest in joy.

00:03:41.476 --> 00:03:47.756
Make the intention to actively invest
in this thing called joy every day.

00:03:47.796 --> 00:03:48.956
Almost like a workout.

00:03:48.996 --> 00:03:50.556
You have to commit to it.

00:03:50.556 --> 00:03:52.476
It has to be a discipline.

00:03:52.476 --> 00:03:54.476
Build and flex that muscle.

00:03:54.516 --> 00:03:57.476
The world does not need
more masochists or martyrs.

00:03:57.516 --> 00:04:01.796
It does not need more overworked,
overstressed burnouts.